"sent_id": "t0015.s03"
},
{
"start": 120.0,
"end": 126.0,
"speaker_label": "Camille Dubois",
"text": "Welcome back to the show.",
"char_start": 2912,
"char_end": 2937,
"unit_id": "t0016.u01",
"sent_id": "t0016.s01"
},
{
"start": 126.0,
"end": 127.66,
"speaker_label": "Camille Dubois",
"text": "That's a helpful perspective.",
"char_start": 2938,
"char_end": 2967,
"unit_id": "t0016.u01",
"sent_id": "t0016.s02"
},
{
"start": 127.66,
"end": 132.0,
"speaker_label": "Camille Dubois",
"text": "Where do the fields of human resources and transmission mechanics intersect?",
"char_start": 2968,
"char_end": 3044,
"unit_id": "t0016.u01",
"sent_id": "t0016.s03"
},
{
"start": 132.0,
"end": 132.45,
"speaker_label": "Mathieu Lefèvre",
"text": "This is how I see it.",
"char_start": 3062,
"char_end": 3083,
"unit_id": "t0017.u01",
"sent_id": "t0017.s01"
},
{
"start": 132.45,
"end": 135.4,
"speaker_label": "Mathieu Lefèvre",
"text": "Most of these mysterious creaking noises can be resolved by cleaning the contact surfaces and tightening the bolts to the specified torque.",
"char_start": 3084,
"char_end": 3223,
"unit_id": "t0017.u01",
"sent_id": "t0017.s02"
},
{
"start": 135.4,
"end": 136.53,
"speaker_label": "Mathieu Lefèvre",
"text": "We've seen this in teams that use Shimano components.",
"char_start": 3224,
"char_end": 3277,
"unit_id": "t0017.u01",
"sent_id": "t0017.s03"
},
{
"start": 136.53,
"end": 138.0,
"speaker_label": "Mathieu Lefèvre",
"text": "I've observed this pattern repeating itself in three different teams.",
"char_start": 3278,
"char_end": 3347,
"unit_id": "t0017.u01",
"sent_id": "t0017.s04"
},
{
"start": 138.0,
"end": 139.46,
"speaker_label": "Camille Dubois",
"text": "Give me a concrete example.",
"char_start": 3364,
"char_end": 3391,
"unit_id": "t0018.u01",
"sent_id": "t0018.s01"
},
{
"start": 139.46,
"end": 144.0,
"speaker_label": "Camille Dubois",
"text": "What did you previously believe about this, and what have you revised your views on?",
"char_start": 3392,
"char_end": 3476,
"unit_id": "t0018.u01",
"sent_id": "t0018.s02"
},
{
"start": 144.0,
"end": 147.55,
"speaker_label": "Mathieu Lefèvre",
"text": "Yes, so – a bike should feel quiet and predictable so that your attention remains focused on the trail.",
"char_start": 3494,
"char_end": 3597,
"unit_id": "t0019.u01",
"sent_id": "t0019.s01"
},
{
"start": 147.55,
"end": 150.0,
"speaker_label": "Mathieu Lefèvre",
"text": "Once you've internalized that, the rest of the decisions become easier.",
"char_start": 3598,
"char_end": 3669,
"unit_id": "t0019.u01",
"sent_id": "t0019.s02"
},
{
"start": 150.0,
"end": 151.43,
"speaker_label": "Camille Dubois",
"text": "Let's start with that.",
"char_start": 3686,
"char_end": 3708,
"unit_id": "t0020.u01",
"sent_id": "t0020.s01"
},
{
"start": 151.43,
"end": 156.0,
"speaker_label": "Camille Dubois",
"text": "What did you previously believe about this, and what have you revised?",
"char_start": 3709,
"char_end": 3779,
"unit_id": "t0020.u01",
"sent_id": "t0020.s02"
},
{
"start": 156.0,
"end": 156.51,
"speaker_label": "Mathieu Lefèvre",
"text": "That's how I see it.",
"char_start": 3797,
"char_end": 3817,
"unit_id": "t0021.u01",
"sent_id": "t0021.s01"
},
{
"start": 156.51,
"end": 158.97,
"speaker_label": "Mathieu Lefèvre",
"text": "The wear and tear on the chain is the best indicator of when you'll need to replace the cassette.",
"char_start": 3818,
"char_end": 3915,
"unit_id": "t0021.u01",
"sent_id": "t0021.s02"
},
{
"start": 158.97,
"end": 160.32,
"speaker_label": "Mathieu Lefèvre",
"text": "We've seen this in teams that use Shimano components.",
"char_start": 3916,
"char_end": 3969,
"unit_id": "t0021.u01",
"sent_id": "t0021.s03"
},
{
"start": 160.32,
"end": 162.0,
"speaker_label": "Mathieu Lefèvre",
"text": "Once you understand that, the rest of the decisions become easier.",
"char_start": 3970,
"char_end": 4036,
"unit_id": "t0021.u01",
"sent_id": "t0021.s04"
},
{
"start": 162.0,
"end": 168.0,
"speaker_label": "Camille Dubois",
"text": "It's settled.\nAlternatively:\nIt's a done deal.\nIt's confirmed.\nIt's arranged.\nIt's agreed.",
"char_start": 4053,
"char_end": 4143,
"unit_id": "t0022.u01",
"sent_id": "t0022.s01"
},
{
"start": 168.0,
"end": 174.0,
"speaker_label": "Mathieu Lefèvre",
"text": "And when teams adopt Spoke & Wrench within this workflow, the trade-offs become apparent. If you ignore these trade-offs, you end up having to rebuild everything from scratch a year later.",
"char_start": 4161,
"char_end": 4349,
"unit_id": "t0023.u01",
"sent_id": "t0023.s01"
},
{
"start": 174.0,
"end": 175.33,
"speaker_label": "Camille Dubois",
"text": "Let's start with that.",
"char_start": 4366,
"char_end": 4388,
"unit_id": "t0024.u01",
"sent_id": "t0024.s01"
},
{
"start": 175.33,
"end": 180.0,
"speaker_label": "Camille Dubois",
"text": "What is the operational perspective that most auditors do not have access to?",
"char_start": 4389,
"char_end": 4466,
"unit_id": "t0024.u01",
"sent_id": "t0024.s02"
},
{
"start": 180.0,
"end": 180.76,
"speaker_label": "Mathieu Lefèvre",
"text": "That's how I see it.",
"char_start": 4484,
"char_end": 4504,
"unit_id": "t0025.u01",
"sent_id": "t0025.s01"
},
{
"start": 180.76,
"end": 183.65,
"speaker_label": "Mathieu Lefèvre",
"text": "The maintenance intervals for the suspension are a risk management decision.",
"char_start": 4505,
"char_end": 4581,
"unit_id": "t0025.u01",
"sent_id": "t0025.s02"
},
{
"start": 183.65,
"end": 186.0,
"speaker_label": "Mathieu Lefèvre",
"text": "I've seen this pattern repeat itself in three different teams.",
"char_start": 4582,
"char_end": 4644,
"unit_id": "t0025.u01",
"sent_id": "t0025.s03"
},
{
"start": 186.0,
"end": 192.0,
"speaker_label": "Camille Dubois",
"text": "Let's change the subject – I want to dedicate the final section to risk management.",
"char_start": 4661,
"char_end": 4744,
"unit_id": "t0026.u01",
"sent_id": "t0026.s01"
},
{
"start": 192.0,
"end": 198.0,
"speaker_label": "Mathieu Lefèvre",
"text": "That's where the conversation becomes interesting, because the compromises related to risk management touch upon everything we've discussed.",
"char_start": 4762,
"char_end": 4902,
"unit_id": "t0027.u01",
"sent_id": "t0027.s01"
},
{
"start": 198.0,
"end": 199.76,
"speaker_label": "Camille Dubois",
"text": "Give me a concrete example.",
"char_start": 4919,
"char_end": 4946,
"unit_id": "t0028.u01",
"sent_id": "t0028.s01"
},
{
"start": 199.76,
"end": 204.0,
"speaker_label": "Camille Dubois",
"text": "What is the most underestimated aspect of transmission mechanics?",
"char_start": 4947,
"char_end": 5012,
"unit_id": "t0028.u01",
"sent_id": "t0028.s02"
},
{
"start": 204.0,
"end": 204.25,
"speaker_label": "Mathieu Lefèvre",
"text": "Of course.",
"char_start": 5030,
"char_end": 5040,
"unit_id": "t0029.u01",
"sent_id": "t0029.s01"
},
{
"start": 204.25,
"end": 207.44,
"speaker_label": "Mathieu Lefèvre",
"text": "Most mysterious creaking noises can be resolved by cleaning the contact surfaces and tightening the bolts to the specified torque.",
"char_start": 5041,
"char_end": 5171,
"unit_id": "t0029.u01",
"sent_id": "t0029.s02"
},
{
"start": 207.44,
"end": 208.65,
"speaker_label": "Mathieu Lefèvre",
"text": "We've seen this in teams that use Spoke & Wrench.",
"char_start": 5172,
"char_end": 5221,
"unit_id": "t0029.u01",
"sent_id": "t0029.s03"
},
{
"start": 208.65,
"end": 210.0,
"speaker_label": "Mathieu Lefèvre",
"text": "I've seen this pattern repeat in three different teams.",
"char_start": 5222,
"char_end": 5277,
"unit_id": "t0029.u01",
"sent_id": "t0029.s04"
},
{
"start": 210.0,
"end": 211.69,
"speaker_label": "Camille Dubois",
"text": "This is a useful perspective.",
"char_start": 5294,
"char_end": 5323,
"unit_id": "t0030.u01",
"sent_id": "t0030.s01"
},
{
"start": 211.69,
"end": 216.0,
"speaker_label": "Camille Dubois",
"text": "What is the contrarian viewpoint that most listeners don't have access to?",
"char_start": 5324,
"char_end": 5398,
"unit_id": "t0030.u01",
"sent_id": "t0030.s02"
},
{
"start": 216.0,
"end": 219.73,
"speaker_label": "Mathieu Lefèvre",
"text": "It all boils down to this: a bike should feel quiet and predictable so that your attention remains focused on the trail.",
"char_start": 5416,
"char_end": 5536,
"unit_id": "t0031.u01",
"sent_id": "t0031.s01"
},
{
"start": 219.73,
"end": 222.0,
"speaker_label": "Mathieu Lefèvre",
"text": "The geometry matters because it tells you what compromises you're making.",
"char_start": 5537,
"char_end": 5610,
"unit_id": "t0031.u01",
"sent_id": "t0031.s02"
},
{
"start": 222.0,
"end": 224.18,
"speaker_label": "Camille Dubois",
"text": "What does the failure mode look like?",
"char_start": 5627,
"char_end": 5664,
"unit_id": "t0032.u01",
"sent_id": "t0032.s01"
},
{
"start": 224.18,
"end": 228.0,
"speaker_label": "Camille Dubois",
"text": "What is the most underestimated aspect of transmission mechanics?",
"char_start": 5665,
"char_end": 5730,
"unit_id": "t0032.u01",
"sent_id": "t0032.s02"
},
{
"start": 228.0,
"end": 230.76,
"speaker_label": "Mathieu Lefèvre",
"text": "Honestly, the wear on the chain is the best early indicator of when you'll need to replace the cassette.",
"char_start": 5748,
"char_end": 5852,
"unit_id": "t0033.u01",
"sent_id": "t0033.s01"
},
{
"start": 230.76,
"end": 232.17,
"speaker_label": "Mathieu Lefèvre",
"text": "We've seen this in teams that use Shimano components.",
"char_start": 5853,
"char_end": 5906,
"unit_id": "t0033.u01",
"sent_id": "t0033.s02"
},
{
"start": 232.17,
"end": 234.0,
"speaker_label": "Mathieu Lefèvre",
"text": "I've observed this pattern repeating itself in three different teams.",
"char_start": 5907,
"char_end": 5976,
"unit_id": "t0033.u01",
"sent_id": "t0033.s03"
},
{
"start": 234.0,
"end": 240.0,
"speaker_label": "Camille Dubois",
"text": "Where is it no longer working?",
"char_start": 5993,
"char_end": 6023,
"unit_id": "t0034.u01",
"sent_id": "t0034.s01"
},
{
"start": 240.0,
"end": 246.0,
"speaker_label": "Mathieu Lefèvre",
"text": "And when teams adopt Shimano equipment, this compromise becomes apparent – I've seen this pattern repeat itself in three different teams.",
"char_start": 6041,
"char_end": 6178,
"unit_id": "t0035.u01",
"sent_id": "t0035.s01"
},
{
"start": 246.0,
"end": 248.22,
"speaker_label": "Camille Dubois",
"text": "What heuristic do you consistently rely on?",
"char_start": 6195,
"char_end": 6238,
"unit_id": "t0036.u01",
"sent_id": "t0036.s01"
},
{
"start": 248.22,
"end": 252.0,
"speaker_label": "Camille Dubois",
"text": "Where do the fields of interviewing and transmission mechanics intersect?",
"char_start": 6239,
"char_end": 6312,
"unit_id": "t0036.u01",
"sent_id": "t0036.s02"
},
{
"start": 252.0,
"end": 255.35,
"speaker_label": "Mathieu Lefèvre",
"text": "Honestly, the maintenance intervals for the suspension are a risk management decision.",
"char_start": 6330,
"char_end": 6416,
"unit_id": "t0037.u01",
"sent_id": "t0037.s01"
},
{
"start": 255.35,
"end": 258.0,
"speaker_label": "Mathieu Lefèvre",
"text": "And the second-order effect is the part that almost everyone misses.",
"char_start": 6417,
"char_end": 6485,
"unit_id": "t0037.u01",
"sent_id": "t0037.s02"
},
{
"start": 258.0,
"end": 264.0,
"speaker_label": "Camille Dubois",
"text": "Before we conclude, what is one thing that listeners can try this week?",
"char_start": 6502,
"char_end": 6573,
"unit_id": "t0038.u01",
"sent_id": "t0038.s01"
},
{
"start": 264.0,
"end": 267.96,
"speaker_label": "Mathieu Lefèvre",
"text": "Choose one of the ideas we discussed and implement it for two weeks.",
"char_start": 6591,
"char_end": 6659,
"unit_id": "t0039.u01",
"sent_id": "t0039.s01"
},
{
"start": 267.96,
"end": 270.0,
"speaker_label": "Mathieu Lefèvre",
"text": "Everything else is about iteration.",
"char_start": 6660,
"char_end": 6695,
"unit_id": "t0039.u01",
"sent_id": "t0039.s02"
},
{
"start": 270.0,
"end": 272.52,
"speaker_label": "Camille Dubois",
"text": "Before we conclude, thank you again to our friends at Linear.",
"char_start": 6712,
"char_end": 6773,
"unit_id": "t0040.u01",
"sent_id": "t0040.s01"
},
{
"start": 272.52,
"end": 276.0,
"speaker_label": "Camille Dubois",
"text": "Linear is the ticketing system designed for speed – built with the keyboard in mind.",
"char_start": 6774,
"char_end": 6858,
"unit_id": "t0040.u01",
"sent_id": "t0040.s02"
},
{
"start": 276.0,
"end": 282.0,
"speaker_label": "Camille Dubois",
"text": "Mathieu Lefèvre, thank you for the conversation.",
"char_start": 6859,
"char_end": 6907,
"unit_id": "t0040.u01",
"sent_id": "t0040.s03"
},
{
"start": 282.0,
"end": 288.0,
"speaker_label": "Mathieu Lefèvre",
"text": "Thank you, Camille.",
"char_start": 6925,
"char_end": 6944,
"unit_id": "t0041.u01",
"sent_id": "t0041.s01"
},
{
"start": 288.0,
"end": 292.43,
"speaker_label": "Camille Dubois",
"text": "That's all for today's episode of Sessions Sentier.",
"char_start": 6961,
"char_end": 7012,
"unit_id": "t0042.u01",
"sent_id": "t0042.s01"
},
{
"start": 292.43,
"end": 294.0,
